SUMMARY:Cyber Monday
DESCRIPTION:Cyber Monday is the Monday after Thanksgiving\, and unlike most
  days on this calendar it has a documented birth date and a traceable moti
 ve. It was invented in November 2005 by Shop.org\, the online-retail arm o
 f the National Retail Federation\, to give internet stores their own answe
 r to Black Friday. Shop.org's own executive director conceded at the time 
 that it was not actually the biggest online shopping day of the year.\n\nh
 ttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/cyber-monday/
